three wishes."

1083
01:11:32,126 --> 01:11:35,029
[Malcolm] <i>Why doesn't the fish</i>
<i>wish itself off the hook?</i>

1084
01:11:35,797 --> 01:11:38,465
[Malcolm] <i>Why doesn't it grant</i>
<i>itself its own freedom?</i>

1085
01:11:39,534 --> 01:11:41,602
[Malcolm] <i>Perhaps</i>
<i>because it knows...</i>

1086
01:11:42,502 --> 01:11:45,773
it is nothing more than a fish.

1087
01:11:47,374 --> 01:11:49,143
[Malcolm] The creatures
that live in this house,

1088
