1104
01:12:37,457 --> 01:12:39,227
[music becomes frightening]

1105
01:12:39,327 --> 01:12:41,562
[animalistic howl]

1106
01:12:54,809 --> 01:12:56,644
[shuddering]

1107
01:12:58,179 --> 01:12:59,814
Malcolm...

1108
